lines = PackedStringArray("All quiet on the east road.", "Dex is the other one. The less punctual one.", "Halt! ...Carry on.", "Square's secure. Road's secure. Moss is suspicious.", "I'm the handsome one.", "Twelve laps of the square and not a bandit in sight.")
